ementally-maintained value when the cache has\nbyte-based sizing (maxBytesLocalHeap) configured. None of our L2 regions\ndo -- ehcache.xml only uses maxElementsInMemory -- so every call falls\nback to walking every element's object graph with Ehcache's\nSizeOfEngine/ObjectGraphWalker, per region, on every single call.\n\nSince a Gauge re-evaluates its supplier on every Prometheus scrape, this\nturned into a full object-graph walk of every cached element in every\nL2 region at the scrape interval -- confirmed live via repeated\n\"configured limit of 1,000 object references was reached ... Severe\nperformance degradation could occur\" warnings from ObjectGraphWalker.\n\nDrop the gauge and keep only the cheap LongAdder-backed counters\n(gets/puts/removals/evictions/hits/misses), which don't touch sizing at\nall.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"568e2971e6a50ca9e0c632e0f368bd2fe1fae05f","tree_id":"9b3ca1f83a801aae4d024885769209b15145c8e5","timestamp":"2026-08-08T05:41:36Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/recei